# Content pipeline (MD → JSON)

## Sources (whitelist, project root)

| MD | Route |
|----|-------|
| `main.md` | `/` (home sections) |
| `bonuses.md` | `/bonuses` |
| `registration.md` | `/registration` |
| `games.md` | `/games` |
| `payments.md` | `/payments` |
| `faq.md` | `/faq` |
| `terms.md` | `/terms` |
| `privacy.md` | `/privacy` |

`README.md`, `figma-plugin-export-tokens/README.md`, and `example/` are **not** parsed.

## Workflow

1. Edit the relevant `*.md` in the project root.
2. Run `npm run sync:content`.
3. Commit both MD and generated `src/app/data/*.json`.

**Do not** hand-edit `src/app/data/*.json` — they are generated.

## Output layout

```
src/app/data/siteMeta.json          ← main.md meta + h1
src/app/data/dataCasinoInfo.json    ← intro + Our Licence
src/app/data/dataLast.json          ← What Sets Us Apart + audience
src/app/data/dataApp.json           ← Languages + Currencies
src/app/data/dataSupport.json
src/app/data/dataFaq.json
src/app/data/dataFooter.json
src/app/data/siteUi.json            ← nav, buttons, labels (static EN)
src/app/data/pages/{slug}.json      ← subpages
```

## Meta in MD

- `**Title:**` / `**Description:**` at top → `meta.title` / `meta.description`
- Home hero h1: `#` heading in `main.md` → `siteMeta.h1`
- Subpage h1: `#` heading, or first `##` when no `#` (e.g. `bonuses.md`)
- Subpage h2: part of `h1` before ` - ` (same rule as home `CasinoInfoSection`)

## Language

Site language is fixed `en` (`<html lang="en">`). No locale/geo routing.

## UI strings

Navigation, buttons, and API-section labels live in `siteUi.json` (English, not from MD). Keep `welcome_section.welcome_offer` as prefix before API offer text in `BonusSection`.

## Page layouts (`StaticRichPage`)

| variant | Pages | Blocks |
|---------|-------|--------|
| `header` | bonuses, registration, games, payments | BonusSection → H1 → h2 → intro → sections → FAQ accordion |
| `footer-legal` | terms, privacy | BonusSection → H1 → h2 → intro → sections |
| `footer-faq` | faq | BonusSection → H1 → h2 → intro → FaqAccordionList |

Nested `###` / `####` inside a `##` section become `{ type: "heading", level: 3|4 }` in `section.content`.
